    "L2": null,
    "L2_null_reason": "RI-AUD03 R1: a layer may be declared null and null is a design statement. The Stone Wastes have no moving texture at all — no wind band, no water, no insect mass. The salt-storm is an L3 EVENT, weather-gated, not a continuous mid layer. A texture here would be the additive reflex R1 exists to stop.",
